    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d327">

                <pb facs="0484" n="396" sameAs="frus:frus1919Parisv02/pg396"/>

                <note rend="inline" type="source">763.72/12517a: Telegram</note>
                <head>
                    <hi rendition="#italic">The Acting Secretary of State
                        to the Ambassador in France</hi> (<hi
                            rendition="#italic">Sharp</hi>)</head>
                <opener>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right">
                        <placeName>
                            <hi rendition="#small-caps">Washington</hi>
                        </placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian" when="1918-12-09T19:00:00-05:00"
                            >December 9, 1918—7 p.m.</date>
                    </dateline>
                </opener>
                <p>6579. Associated Press on November 12, 1918, reported under Paris date a despatch
                    of the Frankfort <hi rendition="#italic">Gazette</hi> in Budapest that the new
                        <pb facs="0485" n="397" xml:id="pg397"/> Roumanian Government had declared
                    war on Germany. Please ascertain if it is a fact that the Roumanian Government
                    has declared war on Germany, and whether the French Government now regards
                    Roumania as at war with Germany on the side of the Allies.</p>
                <closer>
                    <signed>
                        <hi rendition="#small-caps">Polk</hi>
                    </signed>
                </closer>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
